N2  - The dynamic changes across pregnancy affect sleep and wakefulness producing sleep disturbances, which causes sleep disorders in some cases. This review will identify common sleep disorders in pregnancy, related maternal-fetal outcomes, pathophysiologic mechanisms, and potential therapies to guide clinicians in serving this population. © 2012.
