N2  - The annual meeting for the Society of Maternal-Fetal Medicine (SMFM) was held in San Francisco, CA, USA, on 7-12 February 2011. With over 2000 people in attendance, the meeting presented innovative basic science, clinical and epidemiological research. Under the leadership of Joshua Copel (Yale University School of Medicine, CT, USA), President of SMFM, and Alfred Abuhamad (Eastern Virgina Medical School, VA, USA), SMFM Program Chair, the meeting encompassed a wide variety of postgraduate courses, oral and poster sessions, and round-table luncheon presentations with world-renowned speakers. © 2011 Expert Reviews Ltd.
